Z||000023||TRiAD||10-21-2001||12:53 PM||||  <IMG SRC="http://www.ixpres.com/paytel/h6054.jpg">  <P><BR>So, the blue in the corners of the lights...is that a city light? Is it on a different circuit? Or is it a reflection of the bulb sitting in front?<BR>Someone who has them, please let me know.<P>Thanks!<P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg">  <BR><I>Photoshop rendering of planned exterior modifications.</I><p>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 10-21-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000024||watts||10-21-2001||01:48 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by TRiAD:<BR>[BSo, the blue in the corners of the lights...is it a reflection of the bulb sitting in front?[/B]<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Yes, that's a reflection of the blue bulb.<P>||||reg||1
